Maintained packages are packages/fluvie and packages/fluvie_mobile_encoder
at 0.3.1+socialstudio.1. This fork is not published. The capture corrections
are in this tree: render and renderToSandbox prepare captions, and the
offscreen host resolves motion without an application frame. Other workspace
packages stay as upstream published them at v0.3.1.

What changed, recorded 2026-11-12:

- Review hooks, tool/check.sh, a pull request template, a ruleset
  declaration, and a quality workflow for the maintained packages.
- Analyzer adjustments required by Flutter 3.47.9, with a dated ignore for
  the legacy custom_lint plugin registration.
- A lockfile refresh required by that same Flutter pin.
- Publish, image, docs, and website workflows blocked so this fork cannot
  publish or deploy as upstream.
- Capture corrections in the maintained packages: caption preparation in
  render and renderToSandbox, and offscreen host disposal. The limits are
  in docs/fork-maintenance.md.
- The upstream test and coverage jobs are absent from
  .github/workflows/ci.yaml. The reason and the Actions run id are in
  docs/fork-maintenance.md. The historical failures are not claimed fixed.
- The Flutter 3.44.0 workspace analyze job is absent from that same
  workflow. It cannot be strict on both 3.44.0 and the fork pin 3.47.9.
  The pull-request run and the diagnostics are in docs/fork-maintenance.md.

See docs/fork-maintenance.md.
